    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d96-a10">

                <pb facs="0207" n="145" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg145"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 10 in No. 19.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Stahel to Mr. Seward.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-04-03"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 3,
                        1878</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 619.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your dispatch No. 107, I have
                    now the honor to inclose copy of a letter just received from the vice-chairman
                    of the Shanghai Chamber of Commerce, to which body I applied for information on
                    the subject, being myself so little acquainted with matters in China.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>J. STAHEL,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Vice-Consul-General.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
